### Known Failure Case
Query: "Where can I get a letter proving I am a student here?"
Expected: Bonafide certificate FAQ
Model returned: Transcript FAQ (score 0.51)
Reason: With only 20 FAQs and short questions, the model confuses similar
"document request" questions. Fix: add more paraphrased FAQs per topic
and raise the score threshold.